<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center" class="style16">Welcome to the NITW Sustainability  Rating Tool for LVRR Maintenance</p>
<p align="center"><span class="style17">This tool is part of the PhD  research titled: <strong>&quot;DEVELOPMENT OF QUADRUPLE BOTTOMLINE BASED SUSTAINABILITY RATING FRAMEWORK FOR THE MAINTENANCE OF LOW-VOLUME RURAL ROADS&quot;</strong></span></p>
<p align="center"><br />
  <span class="style22">Purpose:</span><br />
  <span class="style17">To evaluate the sustainability performance of maintenance interventions on  low-volume rural roads across environmental, economic, social, material,  management, innovation, technique, and safety dimensions. This module focuses  on quadruple bottom line -QBL (i.e., Environment, Economy, Social and Materials  for sustainable assessment and rating the maintenance level of low volume rural  road across India (LVVR&rsquo;s, India).</span></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><br />
  <span class="style22">Instructions:</span> </p>
  <table width="80%" border="0" align="center">
  <tr>
    <td><span class="style20">1. Please answer all questions honestly based on your knowledge or experience.</span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="style20">2. Each question uses a <strong>1&ndash;5 Likert scale</strong> where 1 represents the lowest or least favorable condition and 5 represents the highest or most favorable condition.</span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="style20">3. Your responses will be anonymized and used only for sustainable assessment and       rating the maintenance level of LVRR&rsquo;s across India.</span></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<br /><br />
<div align="center"><span class="style20"><span class="style15"><strong>Consent Statement: </strong></span>By clicking <strong>Start</strong>,  you confirm that you have read and understood the purpose of this survey, and  you agree to participate voluntarily. </span></div>
<br /><br />
